      "updated": 1793636677466,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Fix: Transport.Proxy = nil, so a variable set for something else cannot turn the check off.\nIf you want a proxy, use one that does the check itself (next diagram).",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "DvsvPx6JPglorh1yQlDa7",
      "originalText": "Fix: Transport.Proxy = nil, so a variable set for something else cannot turn the check off.\nIf you want a proxy, use one that does the check itself (next diagram).",
